helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	uz	The functions provided allow you to edit the points of a curve or an object converted to a curve. The following icons are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153105				0	uz	Edit Points				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3159151				0	uz	The \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Points\"\>\<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\>\</link\> icon allows you to activate or deactivate the edit mode for Bézier objects. In the edit mode, individual points of the drawing object can be selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
