helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierMove\"\>Activates a mode in which you can move points.\</ahelp\> The mouse pointer displays a small empty square when resting on a point. Drag that point to another location. The curve on both sides of the point follows the movement; the section of the curve between the next points changes shape.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	uz	Point at the curve between two points or within a closed curve and drag the mouse to shift the entire curve without distorting the form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
