helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Tools				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149019	1			0	uz	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0106.xhp\" name=\"Tools\"\>Tools\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959	2			0	uz	Use this menu to open and edit the symbol catalog, or import an external formula as a data file. The program interface can be adjusted to meet your requirements. You can also change the program options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150206	4			0	uz	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/06020000.xhp\" name=\"Import Formula\"\>Import Formula\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145385	5			0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Customize\"\>Customize\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
