helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167				0	uz	Fields are used to insert information about the current document, for example, file name, template, statistics, user data, date, and time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470				0	uz	For the HTML export and import of date and time fields, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090007.xhp#datumuhrzeit\" name=\"special $[officename] formats\"\>special $[officename] formats\</link\> are used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
