helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153672	5			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKTYPE\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The following fields are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
