helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983	28			0	uz	Restarts the numbering of footnotes at the top of each page. This option is only available if the \<emph\>End of page \</emph\>check box is selected in the \<emph\>Position \</emph\>area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	uz	Har bir bobga				2002-02-02 02:02:02
