helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153615	80			0	uz	In the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>box, type a space and leave the \<emph\>Or \</emph\>box blank.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	uz	You can now use a condition to insert text based on the contents of the First Name field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
