helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150021				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CalculateSel\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Calculates the selected formula and copies the result to the clipboard.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
