helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154505				0	uz	A paragraph is formatted as a heading when the following conditions are met:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	uz	paragraf bosh harf bilan boshlangan boʻlsa				2002-02-02 02:02:02
