helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149030				0	uz	AutoCorrect for Bullets / Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	uz	To create a bulleted list, type a hyphen (-), star (*), or plus sign (+), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763	18			0	uz	To create a numbered list, type a number followed by a period (.), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147507				0	uz	Automatic numbering is only applied to paragraphs formatted with the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\>, \<emph\>Text body\</emph\> or \<emph\>Text body indent\</emph\> paragraph styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152941				0	uz	AutoCorrect for Separator Lines				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	uz	If you type three or more hyphens (---), underscores (___) or equal signs (===) on line and then press Enter, the paragraph is replaced by a horizontal line as wide as the page. The line is actually the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"lower border\"\>lower border\</link\> of the preceding paragraph. The following rules apply:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530				0	uz	Three hyphens (-) yield a single line (0.05 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	uz	Three underscore (_) yield a single line (1 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150982				0	uz	Three equal signs (=) yield a double line (1.10 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
