helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145244				0	uz	Jadvalni klaviatura yordamida oʻzgartirishngiz va olib tashlashingiz mumkin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150564				0	uz	Ustunlar va satrlar oʻlchamini oʻzgartirish				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153920				0	uz	To resize a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down Alt, and then press the left or the right arrow. To resize the column without changing the width of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the left or the right arrows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147566				0	uz	To increase the left indent of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150759				0	uz	To resize a row, place the cursor in the row, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the up or the down arrows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149286				0	uz	To move the table downwards on the page, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	uz	Ustunlar yoki satrlarni qoʻyish va olib tashlash				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	uz	To insert a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	uz	To delete a column, place the cursor in the column that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	uz	To insert a row, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153531				0	uz	To delete a row, place the cursor in the row that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
