helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154646				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ControlCodes\"\>Shows nonprinting characters in your text, such as paragraph marks, line breaks, tab stops, and spaces.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145410				0	uz	When you delete a paragraph mark, the paragraph that is merged takes on the formatting of the paragraph that the cursor is in.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
