helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151184				0	uz	\<variable id=\"feldbefehltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FieldDialog\"\>Opens a dialog where you can edit the properties of a field. Click in front of a field, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\> In the dialog, you can use the arrow buttons to move to the previous or the next field. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
