helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155180	24			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FORMAT_TABLE:RB_FREE\"\>Horizontally aligns the table based on the values that you enter in the \<emph\>Left\</emph\> and \<emph\>Right\</emph\> boxes in the\<emph\> Spacing\</emph\> area.\</ahelp\> $[officename] automatically calculates the table width. Select this option if you want to specify the individual \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090200.xhp\" name=\"column widths\"\>column widths\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
