helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150350				0	uz	Paragraphs are separated by nonprinting paragraph marks. You can also specify that tabs or a character act as separators when you sort paragraphs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
