helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154190				0	uz	Character				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159196				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_SORTING:ED_TABCH\"\>Enter the character that you want to use as a separator in the selected area.\</ahelp\> By using the separator, $[officename] can determine the position of the sorting key in the selected paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
