helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143276				0	uz	Tabulyasiya (T)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490	16			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_TAB\"\>Inserts a tab stop. To add leader dots to the tab stop, select a character in the \<emph\>Fill character box\</emph\>. To change the position of the tab stop, enter a value in the \<emph\>Tab stop position \</emph\>box, or select the \<emph\>Align right \</emph\>check box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151257				0	uz	Sahifa raqami (#)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
