helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147401				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MergeTable\"\>Combines two consecutive tables into a single table. The tables must be directly next to each other and not separated by an empty paragraph.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
