helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152766				0	uz	Display remainder of name as a suggestion while typing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145758				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_GLOSSARY:CB_INSERT_TIP\"\>Displays a suggestion for completing a word as a Help Tip after you type the first three letters of a word that matches an AutoText entry. To accept the suggestion, press Enter. If more than one AutoText entry matches the letters that you type, press Ctrl+Tab to advance through the entries.\</ahelp\> For example, to insert dummy text, type "Dum", and then press Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177	53			0	uz	To display the list in reverse order, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
