helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	uz	To insert an index entry, select a word in the document, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Indexes and Tables - Entry\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
