helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149823	8			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_MULTMRK:LB_TOX\"\>Edit the index entry if necessary. When you modify the index entry, the new text only appears in the index, and not at the index entry anchor in the document. \</ahelp\> For example, you can enter an index with comments such as "Basics, see also General".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
