helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810	14			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:DLG_JAVAEDIT:ED_URL\"\>Adds a link to a script file. Click the \<emph\>URL \</emph\>radio button, and then enter the link in the box. You can also click the browse button (\<emph\>...\</emph\>), locate the file, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The linked script file is identified in the HTML source code by the following tags:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152963				0	uz	<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript" SRC="url">				2002-02-02 02:02:02
