helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804352213				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click the format that you want to apply to the selected field, or click "Additional formats" to define a custom format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151329				0	uz	For function fields, the format field is only used for fields of the type placeholder. Here, the format determines the object for which the placeholder stands.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
