helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154478				0	uz	\<variable id=\"umlauftext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextWrap\"\>Specify the way you want text to wrap around an object.\</ahelp\> You can also specify the spacing between the text and the object. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151249				0	uz	To wrap text around a table, place the table in a frame, and then wrap the text around the frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
