helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151309				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_SECTION_FTNENDNOTES:CB_FTN_AT_TXTEND\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Adds footnotes at the end of the section. If the section spans more than one page, the footnotes are added to the bottom of the page on which the footnote anchors appear.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
