helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	hd_id129398				0	uz	\<variable id=\"indenting\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indenting.xhp\"\>Indenting Paragraphs\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id9936216				0	uz	You can change the indents for the current paragraph, or for all selected paragraphs, or for a Paragraph Style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7953123				0	uz	You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>. To display the ruler, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Ruler\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	uz	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for the current paragraph or for all selected paragraphs. You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	uz	Right-click a paragraph and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Paragraph Style - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for all paragraphs that have the same Paragraph Style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7271645				0	uz	Indents are calculated with respect to the left and right page margins. If you want the paragraph to extend into the page margin, enter a negative number. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	uz	The indents are different regarding the writing direction. For example, look at the "Before text" indent value in left-to-right languages. The left edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the left page margin. In right-to-left languages, the right edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the right page margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149684				0	uz	\<variable id=\"spellcheck_dialog\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/spellcheck_dialog.xhp\" name=\"Checking Spelling Manually\"\>Checking Spelling Manually\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149814				0	uz	You can manually check the spelling of a text selection or the entire document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828				0	uz	The spellcheck starts at the current cursor position, or at the beginning of the text selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	uz	Click in the document, or select the text that you want to check.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Spelling and Grammar\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104				0	uz	When a possible spelling error is encountered, the \<emph\>Spellcheck \</emph\>dialog opens and $[officename] offers some suggested corrections.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149861				0	uz	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	uz	To accept a correction, click the suggestion, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241				0	uz	Edit the sentence in the upper text box, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	uz	To add the unknown word to a user-defined dictionary, click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
