helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B2				0	uz	For Paragraph and Character Styles, you can drag-and-drop onto the respective icon in the Styles and Formatting window. You do not need to open that style category in advance.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
