helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151077				0	uz	Select the paragraph(s) where you want to add the line numbers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733				0	uz	Select \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
