helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3145092				0	uz	You can remove the numbering from a paragraph in a numbered list or change the number that a numbered list starts with.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id2172612				0	uz	If you want numbered headings, use the \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\> menu command to assign a numbering to a paragraph style. Do not use the Numbering icon on the Formatting toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
