helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	uz	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<emph\>Short name \</emph\>box, and then add additional information to the record in the remaining boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
