helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	uz	Footnotes reference more information about a topic at the bottom of a page and endnotes reference information at the end of the document. $[officename] automatically numbers the footnotes and endnotes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
