helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155903				0	uz	Click in your document where you want to place the anchor of the note.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147120				0	uz	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Footnote/Endnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
