helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Field - Page Count\</emph\>, and then enter a space.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	uz	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Inserting a Scanned Image				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156017				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>inserting;scanned images\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures; scanning\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>scanning pictures\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156017				0	uz	\<variable id=\"insert_graphic_scan\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic_scan.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Scanned Image\"\>Inserting a Scanned Image\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	uz	To insert a scanned image, the scanner must be connected to your system and the scanner software drivers must be installed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182	3			0	uz	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>The scanner must support the TWAIN standard. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>The scanner must support the SANE standard.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	uz	Click in the document where you want to insert the scanned image.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	uz	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Picture - Scan\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Picture - Scan\</emph\>\</link\>, and choose the scanning source from the submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	uz	Follow the scanning instructions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Modifying Cross-References				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149291				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>references; modifying cross-references\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cross-references; modifying\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>editing;cross-references\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>searching;cross-references\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149291				0	uz	\<variable id=\"references_modify\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/references_modify.xhp\" name=\"Modifying Cross-References\"\>Modifying Cross-References\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3153132				0	uz	Click in front of the cross-reference that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	uz	If you cannot see the field shading of the cross-reference, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\> or press \<emph\>Ctrl+F8\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101				0	uz	Set the options that you want, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	uz	Use the arrow buttons in the \<emph\>Edit Fields \</emph\>dialog to browse through the cross-references in the current document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
