helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153397				0	uz	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3156255				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02170000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sections\"\>Format - Sections\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
