helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id5659962				0	uz	If you have a text that was hidden by defining a condition with a variable, you have several options to display the hidden text. Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3152777				0	uz	Enable the check mark at \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902				0	uz	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114				0	uz	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
