helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	uz	Open the spreadsheet containing the chart that you want to copy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	uz	In the spreadsheet, click the chart. Eight handles appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	uz	Drag the chart from the spreadsheet to the text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145102				0	uz	You can resize and move the chart in the text document as you would any object. To edit the chart data, double-click the chart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
