helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3154246				0	uz	Maydonlar hujjatda sana yoki umumiy sahifalar soni kabi oʻzgaruvchi maʼlumotlar uchun ishlatiladi.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154262				0	uz	Viewing Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	uz	Fields consist of a field name and the field content. To switch the field display between the field name or the field content, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"View - Fields\"\>\<emph\>View - Field Names\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153166				0	uz	Maydon xossalari				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3153180				0	uz	Koʻplab maydon turlari, shu bilan birga maʼlumot bazasi maydonlari ham, oʻzgaruvchi qiymatini saqlaydi va koʻrsatadi.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	uz	Quyidagi maydon turlari maydon bosilganda baʼzi amallarni bajaradi:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
