helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id4685201				0	uz	To create text that is not to be printed do the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	uz	Enter text in the frame and if you want, resize the frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
