helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147683				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>spacing; endnotes/footnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>endnotes; spacing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>footnotes; spacing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>borders;for footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>lines;footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147683				0	uz	\<variable id=\"footnote_with_line\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footnote_with_line.xhp\" name=\"Spacing Between Footnotes\"\>Spacing Between Footnotes\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3145808				0	uz	If you want to increase the spacing between footnote or endnote texts, you can add a top and bottom border to the corresponding paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155603				0	uz	Click in a footnote or endnote.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
