helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3154251				0	uz	Right-click the Paragraph Style that you want to modify, for example, "Footnote", and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155884				0	uz	Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Borders\"\>\<emph\>Borders\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	uz	Select "White" in the \<emph\>Color \</emph\>box. If the background of the page is not white, select the color that best matches the background color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	uz	In the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740				0	uz	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3148846				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Format - Paragraph - Borders\"\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Removing Line Breaks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155916				0	uz	\<variable id=\"removing_line_breaks\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/removing_line_breaks.xhp\"\>Removing Line Breaks\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	uz	Use the AutoCorrect feature to remove line breaks that occur within sentences. Unwanted line breaks can occur when you copy text from another source and paste it into a text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153413	3			0	uz	This AutoCorrect feature only works on text that is formatted with the "Default" paragraph style. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149645				0	uz	On the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab, ensure that \<emph\>Combine single line paragraphs if length greater than 50%\</emph\> is selected. To change the minimum percentage for the line length, double-click the option in the list, and then enter a new percentage.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3145093				0	uz	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	uz	Select the text containing the line breaks that you want to remove.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - Apply\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Defining Borders for Pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156136				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>pages;defining borders\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>borders; for pages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>frames; around pages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>defining;page borders\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136	15			0	uz	\<variable id=\"border_page\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/border_page.xhp\" name=\"Defining Borders for Pages\"\>Defining Borders for Pages\</link\> \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	uz	In Writer, you can define borders for page styles, not individual pages. All changes made to borders apply to all pages that use the same page style. Note that page style changes cannot be undone by the Undo function in $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150503				0	uz	Setting a Predefined Border Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page - Borders\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	uz	Select one of the default border styles in the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	uz	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	uz	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	uz	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	uz	Setting a Customized Border Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page - Borders\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	uz	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	uz	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282				0	uz	Repeat the last two steps for every border edge.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	uz	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	uz	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
