helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	uz	If you select 'Text' in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> list, only the text that you enter in the \<emph\>Value\</emph\> box is displayed in the field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
