helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the options for a remote configuration access to your personal $[officename] settings stored on an LDAP server.\</ahelp\> To see this tab page and to use this feature, remote configuration must be active: You need an account on an LDAP server that is running and configured to store $[officename] user settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	uz	Using remote configuration, you can start a copy of $[officename] on any computer in the network with your own user data and personal configuration.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
