helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155176				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_RELATIVE_FSYS\"\>Select this box for \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#speichern\" name=\"relative saving\"\>relative saving\</link\> of URLs in the file system.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
