helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8994109				0	uz	When an update is available, an icon in the menu bar displays some explaining text. Click the icon to proceed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id476699				0	uz	If you disable the check, the icon is removed from the menu bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4057130				0	uz	Online Update is a module that can be selected or deselected to be installed. Choose the customized installation in the Setup of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
