helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_GRID\"\>Specifies the settings for the configurable grid on your document pages. This grid helps you determine the exact position of your objects. You can also set this grid in line with the "magnetic" snap grid.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
