helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4122135				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the visible grid in front of all objects.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1251869				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the snap lines in front of all objects.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D5				0	uz	Specifies to use the Mozilla plug-in to show %PRODUCTNAME documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D8				0	uz	When you click any %PRODUCTNAME document hyperlink in your Mozilla or Netscape browser, one of the following can happen:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DE				0	uz	The browser asks you whether you want to save the document on your disk, or whether you want to use an application to open the document. This request dialog appears by default when you click any %PRODUCTNAME document hyperlink the first time and you did not enable the Mozilla plug-in.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E2				0	uz	The browser downloads the document to a temporary folder, then tells your system to run %PRODUCTNAME and open the document in %PRODUCTNAME. This is the default when you did not enable the Mozilla plug-in and chose to open the document with %PRODUCTNAME when you were first asked.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E6				0	uz	The browser opens a new browser window that shows some of the %PRODUCTNAME icons, and displays the document in the browser window. This is the default when you enable the Mozilla plug-in. When you click the \<emph\>Edit File\</emph\> icon, a copy of the document is downloaded to a temporary folder on your disk, then %PRODUCTNAME starts and loads the copy for editing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F9				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"736117762\"\>Enables the Mozilla plug-in to show %PRODUCTNAME documents in a browser window. Select, click OK, then restart your browser. Then, in the browser window, click any %PRODUCTNAME document hyperlink.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	uz	The plug-in needs a version of Mozilla 1.x, Netscape 6.x, or Netscape 7.x installed on your system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
