helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153527				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>colors; appearance\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>options; appearance\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>appearance options\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
