helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the colors for the $[officename] user interface.\</ahelp\> You can save the current settings as color scheme and load them later.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
