helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153252				0	uz	Scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_COLORCONFIG_LB_COLORSCHEME\"\>Selects the color scheme you want to use.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153665				0	uz	Save				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_COLORCONFIG_PB_SAVESCHEME\"\>Saves the current settings as a color scheme that you can reload later.\</ahelp\> The name is added to the \<emph\>Scheme\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149669				0	uz	Name of color scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_COLORCONFIG_NAME_SCHEME\"\>Enter a name for the color scheme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152811				0	uz	Delete				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_COLORCONFIG_PB_DELETESCHEME\"\>Deletes the color scheme shown in the \<emph\>Scheme\</emph\> box. You cannot delete the Default scheme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148672				0	uz	Scheme				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149204				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_COLORCONFIG_COLORLIST_WIN\"\>Select the colors for the user interface elements.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	uz	To apply a color to a user interface element, ensure that the checkbox in front of the name is marked. To hide a user interface element, clear the check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155430				0	uz	Some user interface elements cannot be hidden.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	uz	In order to enhance cursor visibility, if the user sets the application background color between 40% and 60% gray, it is automatically changed to 40% gray.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153144				0	uz	The \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> color setting changes the user interface element to the preset color from the color scheme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01012000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154921				0	uz	The color settings for "Visited links" and "Unvisited links" only apply to documents created after the settings are applied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Sort Lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145382				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060400.xhp\" name=\"Sort Lists\"\>Sort Lists\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	2			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS\"\>All user-defined lists are displayed in the\<emph\> Sort Lists \</emph\>dialog. You can also define and edit your own lists. Only text can be used as sort lists, no numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149416				0	uz	Lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:LB_LISTS\"\>Displays all the available lists. These lists can be selected for editing.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147531				0	uz	Entries				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:MULTILINEEDIT:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:ED_ENTRIES\"\>Displays the content of the currently selected list. This content can be edited.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145069				0	uz	Copy list from				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:ED_COPYFROM\"\>Defines the spreadsheet and the cells to copy, in order to include them in the \<emph\>Lists\</emph\> box. The currently selected range in the spreadsheet is the default.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151211				0	uz	Copy				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3158409				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_COPY\"\>Copies the contents of the cells in the \<emph\>Copy list from\</emph\> box. If you select a reference to related rows and columns, the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060401.xhp\" name=\"Copy List\"\>\<emph\>Copy List\</emph\>\</link\> dialog appears after clicking the button. You can use this dialog to define if the reference is converted to sort lists by row or by column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154684				0	uz	New/Discard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153970				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_NEW\"\>Enters the contents of a new list into the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> This button will change from \<emph\>New\</emph\> to \<emph\>Discard\</emph\>, which enables you to delete the new list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144760				0	uz	Add/Modify				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_ADD\"\>Adds a new list into the \<emph\>Lists\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> If you would like to edit this list in the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> box, this button will change from \<emph\>Add\</emph\> to \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, which enables you to include the newly modified list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
