helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153728				0	uz	Minimum Change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153139				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:ED_EPS\"\>Specifies the difference between two consecutive iteration step results. If the result of the iteration is lower than the minimum change value, then the iteration will stop.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
