helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:BTN_DATESC10\"\>Sets 1/1/1900 as day zero. Use this setting for StarCalc 1.0 spreadsheets containing date entries.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
