helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040400.xhp	0	help	par_id2021546				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable this option to print text that is marked as hidden.\</ahelp\> The following hidden text is printed: text that is formatted as hidden by \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020200.xhp\"\>Format - Character - Font Effects - Hidden\</link\>, and the text fields \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\"\>Hidden text and Hidden paragraphs\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
