helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_TIPHELP\"\>Hides the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\" name=\"Help tips\"\>Help tips\</link\> after the number of seconds that you enter.\</ahelp\> Otherwise, Help tips are displayed until you press Escape or move the cursor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
