helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156275				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_MTR_FLD_BEZ_ANGLE\"\>Defines the angle for point reduction.\</ahelp\> When working with polygons, you might find it useful to reduce their editing points.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
