helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10561				0	uz	Add, modify, or remove entries to the list of registered databases. You must register a database within %PRODUCTNAME in order to see it in the \<emph\>View - Data sources\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058E				0	uz	Registered Databases				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10592				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"35535\"\>Lists the registered name and database file of all registered databases. Double-click an entry to edit.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	uz	New				2002-02-02 02:02:02
