helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10549				0	uz	You can use this dialog to enter optional start parameters for the Java runtime environment (JRE). The settings that you specify in this dialog are valid for any JRE that you start.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
