helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150008				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXFLOAT_3D:BTN_GEO\"\>Adjusts the shape of the selected 3D object. You can only modify the shape of a 3D object that was created by converting a 2D object. To convert a 2D object to 3D, select the object, right-click, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To 3D\</emph\>, or \<emph\>Convert - To 3D Rotation Object\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
