helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	44			0	uz	You can display the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as icons, or icons with titles and path information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	uz	To zoom in or zoom out on a single object in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, double-click the object, or select the object, and then press the Spacebar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3145346				0	uz	Themes are listed on the left side of the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_THEMELIST\"\>Click a theme to view the objects associated with the theme.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
