helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116				0	uz	Always save your document in a \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> file type before saving it to an external file type. When you export to an external file type, some formatting features may be lost.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
