helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150744				0	uz	If you use different font sizes within a paragraph, the line spacing is automatically adjusted to the largest font size. If you prefer to have identical spacing for all lines, specify a value in \<emph\>At least\</emph\> that corresponds to the largest font size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
