helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05080400.xhp	0	help	par_id3146856				0	uz	\<variable id=\"blocktext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:JustifyPara\"\>Aligns the selected paragraph(s) to the left and the right page margins. If you want, you can also specify the alignment options for the last line of a paragraph by choosing \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Alignment\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
