helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	uz	This \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> dialog is only available for Fontwork in old Writer text documents that were created prior to %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION. You must first call \<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\> to add a menu command or an icon to open this dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154497				0	uz	You can change the shape of the text baseline to match semicircles, arcs, circles, and freeform lines.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
