helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3154044				0	uz	\<variable id=\"export\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"FILTER_EDIT_RID_PDF_EXPORT_DLG_ED_PAGES\"\>Saves the current file to Portable Document Format (PDF) version 1.4.\</ahelp\> A PDF file can be viewed and printed on any platform with the original formatting intact, provided that supporting software is installed. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id746482				0	uz	General				2002-02-02 02:02:02
