helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3144438				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_NUM_POSITION:MF_BORDERDIST\"\>Enter the amount of space to leave between the left page margin (or the left edge of the text object) and the left edge of the numbering symbol. If the current paragraph style uses an indent, the amount you enter here is added to the indent.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
