helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	2			0	uz	\<variable id=\"massstabtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Zoom\"\>Reduces or enlarges the screen display of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The current zoom factor is displayed as a percentage value on the \<emph\>Status\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655				0	uz	Zooming is handled differently on Unix, Linux, and Windows platforms. A document saved with a 100% zoom factor in Windows is displayed at a larger zoom factor on Unix/Linux platforms. To change the zoom factor, double-click or right-click the percentage value on the \<emph\>Status\</emph\> bar, and select the zoom factor that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149669				0	uz	Zoom factor				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154389				0	uz	Set the zoom factor at which to display the current document and all documents of the same type that you open thereafter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
