helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\moviesound.xhp	0	help	par_idN10683				0	uz	To insert a movie or sound file into your document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\moviesound.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068A				0	uz	Click where you want to insert the file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
