helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id5201879				0	uz	Every user with write permission to the text document can edit and delete notes of all authors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id2571794				0	uz	The note box contains an icon with a down arrow. Click the icon to open a menu with some commands to delete notes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0522200809383431				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Delete the current note.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0522200809383485				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Delete all notes by this author in the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
