helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BUSINESS_FMT_PAGE_TYPE\"\>Select the size format that you want to use. The available formats depend on what you selected in the \<emph\>Brand\</emph\> list. If you want to use a custom size format, select \<emph\>[User]\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010202.xhp\" name=\"Format\"\>\<emph\>Format\</emph\>\</link\> tab to define the format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	uz	Info				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	uz	The paper type and the dimensions of the business card are displayed at the bottom of the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140402.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Change Icon				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06140402.xhp	0	help	par_idN10543				0	uz	Change Icon				2002-02-02 02:02:02
