helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146067				0	uz	The anchor is displayed in front of the character.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152924	4			0	uz	To align a graphic relative to the character that it is anchored to, right-click the graphic, and then choose \<emph\>Graphics\</emph\>. Click the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>tab, and in the \<emph\>Position \</emph\>area, select \<emph\>Character\</emph\> in the \<emph\>to\</emph\> boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
