helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148585				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVIGATOR_GLOB_TREELIST\"\>The Navigator lists the main components of the master document. If you rest the mouse pointer over a name of a sub-document in the list, the full path of the sub-document is displayed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	uz	The master view in the Navigator displays the following icons:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
