helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3174230				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Mark to enable the automatic check for updates. Choose Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - Online Update to disable or enable this feature.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
