helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8132267				0	uz	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help - Check for Updates\</item\> to check manually.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3422345				0	uz	If an update is available, an icon \<image id=\"img_id3155415\" src=\"extensions/source/update/ui/onlineupdate_16.png\" width=\"0.4598inch\" height=\"0.1402inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155415\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the menu bar will notify you of the update. Click the icon to open a dialog with more information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9313638				0	uz	You will see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/online_update_dialog.xhp\"\>Check for Updates\</link\> dialog with some information about the online update of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9951780				0	uz	Enable an Internet connection for %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3639027				0	uz	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Check for Updates\</item\> to check for the availability of a newer version of your office suite.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3722342				0	uz	If a newer version is available and %PRODUCTNAME is not set up for automatic downloading, then you can select any of the following actions:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id5106662				0	uz	Download the new version.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4931485				0	uz	Install the downloaded files.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9168980				0	uz	Abort this check for updates for now.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9766533				0	uz	If %PRODUCTNAME is configured to download the files automatically, the download starts immediately. A download continues even when you minimize the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6081728				0	uz	If no update was found, you can close the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9219641				0	uz	You need Administrator rights to update %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
