helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154613				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AlignTop\"\>Vertically aligns the top edges of the selected objects. If only one object is selected in Draw or Impress, the top edge of the object is aligned to the upper page margin.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
