helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Set the typographic options for cells or paragraphs in Asian language files. To enable Asian language support, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Enabled\</emph\> box in the \<emph\>Asian language support \</emph\>area.\</ahelp\> The Asian typography options are ignored in HTML documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
