helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149191				0	uz	Template categories are represented by folder icons. To view the template files for a category, double-click a folder.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159166				0	uz	To view the styles that are used in a file, double-click the file name, and then double-click the \<emph\>Styles\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504				0	uz	To copy a style, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>and drag the style from one file to another file. To move a style, drag the style from one file to another file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
