helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10554				0	uz	Select the formatting template that you want to use for the layout of the index page of your site. The template defines the text formatting and the position of elements on the page. Some of the available layouts use frames.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
