helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	uz	\<variable id=\"autopilot\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_AUTOPILOT\"\>Use the wizard to interactively create a presentation. With the wizard, you can modify the sample templates to suit your needs.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The wizard takes you step by step through the design elements and offers various editing options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	uz	Within each wizard page, you can undo, modify, or skip altogether the editing steps. If you decide to skip over one of the pages, the wizard uses the default settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159269	4			0	uz	<< Back				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_ASS:BUT_LAST\"\>Returns to the previous step without deleting your current settings.\</ahelp\> You can only select this button after the second editing step.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153349	6			0	uz	Next >>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156307				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_ASS:BUT_NEXT\"\>Accepts the new settings and moves to the next page.\</ahelp\> You will not be able to select this button in the last editing step.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156327				0	uz	Create				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	uz	The wizard creates a new document based on the specified settings. You can later specify a name for the document and save it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	uz	$[officename] saves the current wizard settings and uses them as default the next time you open the wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
