helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can create the report as a static or dynamic report. When you open a dynamic report, it will display with the current data contents. When you open a static report, it will always display the same data from the time when the static report was created.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
