helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	uz	Return to the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Presentation Wizard\"\>Presentation Wizard\</link\> title page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Fax Wizard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
