helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	uz	Icons in the Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	uz	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	uz	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	uz	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	uz	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
