helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FIELD_SEL\"\>The field selection window lists all database fields of the table or query that was specified as the data source in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170201.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147620				0	uz	You can insert a field into the current document by dragging and dropping. A field is then inserted which contains a link to the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
