helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3153577\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_objectalign.png\" width=\"0.2228inch\" height=\"0.2228inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153577\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
