helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GraphicFilterToolbox\"\>This icon on the \<emph\>Picture\</emph\> bar opens the \<emph\>Graphic Filter\</emph\> bar, where you can use various filters on the selected picture.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154673				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3152924\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfiltertoolbox.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152924\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
