helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148495				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3156437\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_graphicfilterpopart.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156437\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
