helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ViewFormAsGrid\"\>Activates an additional table view when in the form view.\</ahelp\> When the\<emph\> Data source as table\</emph\> function is activated, you see the table in an area above the form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3093440				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3156414\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_viewformasgrid.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156414\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	uz	Data source as table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	uz	The table view and form view reflect the same data. Changes made in the table are also visible in the form, and changes to the form are visible in the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	uz	If there are several logical forms in a document, the table is only able to show one at a time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Move Down				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148520				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/06110000.xhp\" name=\"Move Down\"\>Move Down\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154228				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveDown\"\>Positions the selected paragraph after the one below it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158405	5			0	uz	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Down \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149751				0	uz	This function can be called by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down Arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3153577\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_outlinedown.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153577\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
