helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154044				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/24100000.xhp\" name=\"Crop\"\>Crop\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154863				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafAttrCrop\"\>Allows to crop the display of an inserted picture. Only the display gets cropped, the inserted picture is not changed.\</ahelp\> A picture must be selected to enable cropping.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24100000.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200804261097				0	uz	In Impress and Draw no dialog is shown when you click the icon, but you see eight cropping handles. Open the context menu of a selected picture and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Crop Picture\</item\>, if you want to use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030800.xhp\"\>dialog\</link\> for cropping.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24100000.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200804261043				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Drag any of the eight cropping handles to crop the picture.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24100000.xhp	0	help	par_id0522200809440491				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id0522200809434429\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_crop.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id0522200809434429\"\>icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
