helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152918				0	uz	Unlike the normal search, which is activated by the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100200.xhp\" name=\"Find Record\"\>Find Record\</link\> icon on the \<emph\>Form\</emph\> Bar, you can search more quickly by using the form-based filter. Usually a quick database server is charged with the search. Also, you can enter more complex search conditions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
