helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150935				0	uz	Double-clicking this field opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/03010000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom\"\>Zoom\</link\> dialog, where you can change the current zoom factor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	uz	Open the context menu on this field to see a selection of available zoom factors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Comparison Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148983				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>comparisons;operators in default filter dialog\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>operators; default filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>default filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>equal sign, see also operators\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148983				0	uz	Comparison Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	uz	Equal (=)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	uz	Shows values equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	uz	Less than (<)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	uz	Shows values less than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807				0	uz	Greater than (>)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	uz	Shows values greater than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	uz	Less than or equal to (< =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381				0	uz	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	uz	Greater than or equal to (> =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	uz	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	uz	Not equal (< >)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	uz	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	uz	Largest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	uz	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) largest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	uz	Smallest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	uz	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) smallest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	uz	Largest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161645				0	uz	Shows the largest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the total values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202				0	uz	Smallest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	uz	Shows the smallest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the entire values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
