helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153089	2			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditDoc\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enables you to edit a read-only document or database table.\</ahelp\> Use the\<emph\> Edit File\</emph\> icon to activate or deactivate the edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
