helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	uz	Hyperlinks to any document or targets in documents can be edited using the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab from the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
