helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155555				0	uz	Filter criteria				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147834				0	uz	You can define a filter by indicating the type of line, the name of the field, a logical condition and a value or a combination of arguments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
