helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_LISTBOX_DLG_FILTERCRIT_LB_WHEREFIELD3\"\>Specifies the field names from the current table to set them in the argument.\</ahelp\> You will see the column identifiers if no text is available for the field names.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
