helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	uz	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also use the color sliders to apply a uniform color to the monochrome graphic object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
