helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	uz	Pica				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3144760				0	uz	pc				2002-02-02 02:02:02
