helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148755				0	uz	Reset				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149651				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_RESET_BTN\"\>Resets changes made to the current tab to those applicable when this dialog was opened. A confirmation query does not appear when you close the dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
