helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154331				0	uz	A confirmation query does not appear. If you confirm the dialog with OK all settings in this dialog are reset.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145173				0	uz	Standard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154153				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_STANDARD_BTN\"\>Resets the values visible in the dialog back to the default installation values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154299				0	uz	A confirmation does not appear before the defaults are reloaded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
