helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152791	61			0	uz	\<variable id=\"wiederholen\"\>By double-clicking a tool, you can use it for multiple tasks. If you call the tool with a single-click, it reverts back to the last selection after completing the task. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
