helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id7145298				0	uz	Save cell content as shown				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id5719779				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enabled by default, data will be saved as displayed, including applied number formats. If this checkbox is not marked, raw data content will be saved, as in older versions of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3541062				0	uz	Depending on the number format, saving cell content as shown may write values that during an import cannot be interpreted as numerical values anymore.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149793				0	uz	Fixed column width				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCDLG_IMPORTOPT_CB_FIXEDWIDTH\"\>Exports all data fields with a fixed width.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	uz	The width of a data field in the exported text file is set to the current width of the corresponding column.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116				0	uz	Values are exported in the format as currently seen in the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	uz	If a value is longer than the fixed column width, it will be exported as a ### string.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	uz	If a text string is longer than the fixed column width, it will be truncated at the end.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	uz	The alignment Left, Centered, and Right will be simulated by inserted blanks.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
