helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149581				0	uz	On the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab page, select a background color or a background graphic.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154097				0	uz	In spreadsheets this background appears only in the print behind the cells not formatted elsewhere.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
