helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149964				0	uz	-env				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id2439039				0	uz	Sets another environment for the program start.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id2789086				0	uz	Use soffice -env:UserInstallation=$(URL) where $(URL) is the URL of a folder that contains the "user" folder.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
