helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3163666				0	uz	Prints the files \<emph\>{filename1} {filename2} ...\</emph\> to the default printer and ends. The splash screen does not appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3150828				0	uz	If the file name contains spaces, then it must be enclosed in quotation marks.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3150883				0	uz	-pt {Printername} {filename1} {filename2} ...				2002-02-02 02:02:02
