helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155126				0	uz	-nologo				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151334				0	uz	Disables the splash screen at program start.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171				0	uz	-nodefault				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153306				0	uz	Starts without displaying anything except the splash screen.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id2211676				0	uz	-nofirststartwizard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
