helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803105015				0	uz	\<emph\>Formula\</emph\> opens %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"text/smath/main0000.xhp\"\>Math\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803105045				0	uz	The \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> icon opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/aaa_start.xhp\"\>Templates and Documents\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
