helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	uz	Select a theme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148617				0	uz	Select an object by a single click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
