helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	uz	Click the arrow icon at the end of a toolbar and choose \<emph\>Visible Buttons\</emph\> and then select the button you want to display.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id2439039				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens a dialog where you can add, edit, and remove icons.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
