helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>, and click on the \<emph\>Toolbars\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3154071	88			0	uz	In the\<emph\> Toolbars \</emph\>box, select the toolbar you want to change.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	uz	Click \<emph\>Add Commands\</emph\> , select the new command, then click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3152922	90			0	uz	If you want, you can rearrange the \<emph\>Commands \</emph\>list by selecting a command name and clicking \<emph\>Move Up\</emph\> and \<emph\>Move Down\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\edit_symbolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	uz	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
