helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>File - Save as\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Save as\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
