helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201	1			0	uz	\<variable id=\"redlining_protect\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining_protect.xhp\" name=\"Protecting Records\"\>Protecting Records\</link\> \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	uz	The review function is available in %PRODUCTNAME for text documents and spreadsheet documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	uz	To protect the changes made in a document during editing, choose \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Protect Records\</emph\>. To turn off the function or to accept or reject changes it is necessary to enter the correct password first.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Protect Records\</emph\>. This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/password_dlg.xhp\" name=\"Password\"\>\<emph\>Password\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	uz	Enter a password consisting of at least 5 characters and confirm it. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
