helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	uz	The \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar can be used to search for the selected text in the Internet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10620				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\> to open the Hyperlink Bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	uz	Enter the text you want to find in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
