helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	uz	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
