helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943				0	uz	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148948				0	uz	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
