helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3139133				0	uz	Different methods exist to start a chart:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6772972				0	uz	Insert a chart based on data from cells in Calc or Writer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6049684				0	uz	These charts update automatically when the source data changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2356944				0	uz	Insert a chart with a default data set, and then use the Data Table dialog to enter your own data for that chart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id866115				0	uz	These charts can be created in Writer, Impress and Draw. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
