helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id6436658				0	uz	Chart based on values of its own				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6944792				0	uz	In Writer, if you have not selected any cells, choose \<emph\>Insert - Object - Chart\</emph\> to insert a chart with default data. In Draw or Impress, choose \<emph\>Insert - Chart\</emph\> to insert a chart based on default data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
