helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069C				0	uz	On the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> toolbar, click the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> icon. \<image id=\"img_id7040009\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fontworkgalleryfloater.png\" width=\"0.1701inch\" height=\"0.1701inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7040009\"\>Fontwork icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	uz	In the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> dialog, select a Fontwork style and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	uz	Double-click the object to enter text edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D5				0	uz	Replace the default Fontwork text with your own text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A8				0	uz	Press Esc to exit text edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AE				0	uz	To edit a Fontwork object				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	uz	The \<link href=\"text/shared/fontwork_toolbar.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar is displayed. If you do not see the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Fontwork\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BC				0	uz	Click an icon in the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
