helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	uz	Fontwork Gallery - adds another Fontwork object				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	uz	Fontwork Shape - edits the shape				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	uz	Fontwork Same Letter Heights - changes the height of characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	uz	Fontwork Alignment - aligns the text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D9				0	uz	Fontwork Character Spacing - changes the character spacing and kerning				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN108CA				0	uz	To edit more Fontwork attributes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D5				0	uz	Select the properties from the \<emph\>Drawing Object Properties\</emph\> toolbar. You can change the line width, line color, fill color, fill style, and more.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E7				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/fontwork_toolbar.xhp\"\>Fontwork toolbar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
