helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147008				0	uz	Setting a Predefined Border Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	uz	Select the table cells that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346	3			0	uz	Click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Table \</emph\>toolbar (Writer) or on the \<emph\>Line and Filling\</emph\> bar to open the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	uz	Click one of the predefined border styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	uz	This \<emph\>adds\</emph\> the selected style to the current border style of the table cells. Select the blank border style at the top left of the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> window to clear all border styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153666				0	uz	Setting a Customized Border Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	uz	Select the table cells that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Table - Table Properties - Borders\</emph\> (Writer) or \<emph\>Format - Cells - Borders\</emph\> (Calc).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	uz	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3153526				0	uz	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	uz	Repeat the last two steps for every border edge.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	uz	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3149807				0	uz	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
