helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0A				0	uz	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B19				0	uz	Select the filter you want to delete and click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
