helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	uz	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	uz	You are free to change the items on the menu bar. You can delete items, add new ones, copy items from one menu to another, rename them, and so on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	uz	The toolbars may be freely configured.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
