helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	uz	To change these, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
