helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F9				0	uz	\<variable id=\"data_forms\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_forms.xhp\"\>Working with Forms\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	uz	Using forms, you can define how to present the data. Open a text document or a spreadsheet and insert the controls such as push buttons and list boxes. In the properties dialogs of the controls, you can define what data the forms should display.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	uz	Creating a New Form With the Form Wizard				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	uz	In %PRODUCTNAME, you can create a new form using the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01090000.xhp\"\>Form Wizard\</link\>:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10632				0	uz	Open the database file where you want to create the new form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10636				0	uz	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1063E				0	uz	Click \<emph\>Use Wizard to Create Form\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10645				0	uz	Creating a New Form Manually				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064C				0	uz	Open the database file where you want to create the new form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10650				0	uz	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10658				0	uz	Click \<emph\>Create Form in Design View\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065F				0	uz	A new text document opens. Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\"\>Form Controls\</link\> to insert form controls.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10670				0	uz	Click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon to access all forms that were created from within the current database window. In addition, you can use the \<emph\>Form Controls\</emph\> icons to add database form controls to any Writer or Calc document, but these documents will not be listed in the database window. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels_database.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Printing Address Labels				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels_database.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147399				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>address labels from databases\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>labels; from databases\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>stickers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>databases;creating labels\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
