helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	uz	Index details				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938	16			0	uz	As soon as you change a detail of the current index and then select another index, the change is immediately passed to the data source. You can only leave the dialog, or select another index, if the change has been successfully acknowledged by the data source. However, you can undo the change by clicking the \<emph\>Reset Current Index \</emph\>icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154138				0	uz	Unique				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282	18			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_CHECKBOX_DLG_INDEXDESIGN_CB_UNIQUE\"\>Specifies whether the current index allows only unique values.\</ahelp\> Checking the \<emph\>Unique \</emph\>option prevents duplicate data from being entered in the field and ensures data integrity.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150448				0	uz	Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085	20			0	uz	The\<emph\> Fields\</emph\> area displays a list of fields in the current table. You can also select multiple fields. In order to remove a field from the selection, select the empty entry at the start of the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
