helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	2			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Lets you organize dBASE database indexes.\</ahelp\> An index allows you to access a database quickly, provided that you query the data in the selection that was defined through the index. When you design a table, you can define the indexes on the \<emph\>Indexes \</emph\>tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
