helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155350				0	uz	returns data fields with field contents such as "Sun".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152883				0	uz	BETWEEN 10 AND 20				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159406				0	uz	returns field names with field content between the values 10 and 20. (The fields can be either text fields or number fields).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148765				0	uz	IN (1; 3; 5; 7)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149712				0	uz	returns field names with the values 1, 3, 5, 7. If the field name contains an item number, for example, you can create a query that returns the item having the specified number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
