helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157998				0	uz	\<emph\>Date fields\</emph\> are represented as #Date# to clearly identify them as dates. The date condition will be reproduced in the resulting SQL statement in the following ODBC - compliant way:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
