helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151220	260			0	uz	$[officename] also supports the following \<emph\>Escape sequences\</emph\> known from ODBC and JDBC:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
