helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	uz	The Form Controls toolbar offers the tools required to create a form in a text, table, drawing, or presentation document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155388				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Form in Design Mode\"\>Form in Design Mode\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	uz	In design mode, the form is designed and the properties of the form and the controls contained in it are defined.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
