helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151205				0	uz	If you double-click a connection between two linked fields in the query design, or if you choose \<emph\>Insert - New Relation\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Relations\</emph\> dialog appears. These properties will be used in all queries created in the future.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
