helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_NUMERICFIELD_TAB_PAG_ADABAS_SETTINGS_NF_DATA_INCREMENT\"\>Enter the size by which you want to automatically increment the database. The maximum increment size is 100 MB.\</ahelp\> The setting takes effect after you restart the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156346				0	uz	Control User Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
