helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163829				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05030300.xhp\" name=\"Type formatting\"\>Type formatting\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	2			0	uz	In the data source explorer, you can copy a table by dragging and dropping the table onto the table container. The\<emph\> Type formatting \</emph\>dialog is the third window of the \<emph\>Copy table\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152801				0	uz	List box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_MULTILISTBOX_TAB_WIZ_TYPE_SELECT_LB_NEW_COLUMN_NAMES\"\>Lists the data fields that will be included in to the copied table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
