helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F8				0	uz	Document as E-mail				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FC				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the default e-mail application to send a new e-mail. The current database file is appended as an attachment. You can enter the subject, the recipients and a mail body.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FF				0	uz	Report as E-mail				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN10603				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the default e-mail application to send a new e-mail. The selected report is appended as an attachment. You can enter the subject, the recipients and a mail body. A dynamic report is exported as a copy of the database contents at the time of export.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN10606				0	uz	Report to Text Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
