helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_RADIOBUTTON_TAB_WIZ_COPYTABLE_RB_VIEW\"\>If the database supports Views, you can select this option only when a query is copied in a table container. This option enables you to see and edit a query as a normal table view.\</ahelp\> The table will be filtered in the view with a "Select" SQL statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
