helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018				0	uz	The inserted text uses the default text formatting of the active slide. If you want, you can drag a text frame in your slide, and then insert the text. The text frame automatically extends downwards for longer text passages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
