helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658				0	uz	A Dimension Line is always inserted on the \<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/layer_tipps.xhp\" name=\"layer\"\>layer\</link\> called \<emph\>Dimension Lines\</emph\>. If you set that layer to invisible, you will not see any Dimension Line in your drawing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
