helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584				0	uz	If you select "Macromedia Flash (SWF)" as file format, the current Impress or Draw document will be exported to the Macromedia Flash format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153817	7			0	uz	If you choose "HTML Document" as your file format, the \<emph\>HTML Export \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01110000.xhp\" name=\"AutoPilot\"\>Wizard\</link\> appears. This wizard guides you through the export process and includes the option to save the pictures in your presentation in GIF or JPG format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
