helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149883				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HideSlide\"\>Hides the selected slide so that it is not displayed during a slide show.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	uz	The number of a hidden slide is crossed out. To show a hidden slide, choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Show/Hide Slide\</emph\> again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3156067\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_hideslide.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156067\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
