helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155179				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EllipseCut_Unfilled\"\>Draws an empty shape that is defined by the arc of an oval and a diameter line in the current document. To draw an ellipse segment, drag an ellipse to the size you want, and then click to define the starting point of the diameter line. Move your pointer to where you want to place the endpoint of the diameter line and click. You do not need to click on the ellipse. To draw a circle segment, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
