helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3153785				0	uz	To preview the transition effect for a slide, click the small icon underneath the slide on the \<emph\>Slides Pane\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
