helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593	56			0	uz	If you want the selected custom slide show to start when you click the \<emph\>Slide Show\</emph\> icon on the\<emph\> Presentation\</emph\> toolbar, or when you press F5, select \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145169				0	uz	Options for Running a Slide Show				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150335				0	uz	To always start a slide show from the current slide:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3155932				0	uz	In the \<emph\>Start presentation\</emph\> area, select the \<emph\>Always with current page\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3155372				0	uz	Do not select this option if you want to run a custom slide show.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153922				0	uz	To hide a slide:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3083278				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3151264				0	uz	The slide is not removed from your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147570				0	uz	To show a hidden slide:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3145210				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>View - Slide Sorter\</emph\>, and then select the hidden slide(s) that you want to show.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150260				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
