helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385				0	uz	To set the default printing options for $[officename] Impress, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153914				0	uz	Setting printer options for the current presentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
