helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	uz	These settings override the default printer options in \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\> for the current print job only.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
