helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id7197790				0	uz	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Print\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id9354533				0	uz	Select the number of slides to print per page of paper.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id6556596				0	uz	Defining print options for handouts				2002-02-02 02:02:02
