helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id996734				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Page Number\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Header and Footer\</emph\> dialog box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id6752220				0	uz	Click \<emph\>Notes and Handouts\</emph\> to enter the header and footer text for handouts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id5703909				0	uz	You see four areas on this dialog with check boxes for Header, Date and time, Footer, and Page number. These four areas correspond to the four areas in the corners of the handout master view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id4984282				0	uz	Enter text for header, footer, and date. Check the \<emph\>Page number\</emph\> box, if you want to number the handout pages. Ensure the \<emph\>Header\</emph\> check box is enabled if you want your header text to be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id816064				0	uz	Click \<emph\>Apply to All\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id863063				0	uz	The fields in the handout master view on screen are not updated, but the text that you entered will be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
