helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id6821192				0	uz	If you want another layout of the slides on the printed paper pages, use the mouse to move the slides around on the Handout view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151389				0	uz	Printing a range of slides				2002-02-02 02:02:02
