helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\gradient.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	uz	Select a drawing object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\gradient.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\> and select \<emph\>Gradient\</emph\> as the \<emph\>Fill\</emph\> type.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\gradient.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	uz	Select a gradient style from the list and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
