helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataFilterAutoFilter\"\>Automatically filters the selected cell range, and creates one-row list boxes where you can choose the items that you want to display.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
