helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145364				0	uz	Data source				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:COMBOBOX:RID_SCDLG_DAPIDATA:CB_OBJECT\"\>Select the data source that you want to use.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147428				0	uz	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_DAPIDATA:LB_OBJTYPE\"\>Click the source type of for the selected data source.\</ahelp\> You can choose from four source types: "Table", "Query" and "SQL" or SQL (Native).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
