helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159399				0	uz	Hyphenation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068	2			0	uz	\<variable id=\"silben\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Hyphenate\"\>The \<emph\>Hyphenation \</emph\>command calls the dialog for setting the hyphenation in $[officename] Calc.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	uz	You can only turn on the automatic hyphenation in $[officename] Calc when the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340300.xhp\" name=\"row break\"\>row break\</link\> feature is active.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153192				0	uz	Hyphenation for selected cells.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	uz	Select the cells for which you want to change the hyphenation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150440				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Hyphenation\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	uz	The \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> dialog appears with the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> tab page open.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	uz	Mark the \<emph\>Wrap text automatically\</emph\> and \<emph\>Hyphenation active\</emph\> check boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153094				0	uz	Hyphenation for Drawing Objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148577				0	uz	Select a drawing object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156285				0	uz	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Hyphenation\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	uz	Each time you call the command you turn the hyphenation for the drawing object on or off. A check mark shows the current status.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
