helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146972				0	uz	Up				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153711				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_TOP\"\>Creates an upward series in the cell range of the column using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153764				0	uz	Left				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_LEFT\"\>Creates a series running from right to left in the selected cell range using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147344				0	uz	Series Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257	15			0	uz	Defines the series type. Choose between \<emph\>Linear, Growth, Date \</emph\>and \<emph\>AutoFill\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
