helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149528				0	uz	Date				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150887				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DATE\"\>Creates a date series using the defined increment and end date.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150202				0	uz	AutoFill				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155811				0	uz	AutoFill tries to complete a value series by using a defined pattern. The series 1,3,5 is automatically completed with 7,9,11,13, and so on. Date and time series are completed accordingly; for example, after 01.01.99 and 15.01.99, an interval of 14 days is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148700				0	uz	Unit of Time				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153308				0	uz	In this area you can specify the desired unit of time. This area is only active if the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> option has been chosen in the \<emph\>Series type\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
