helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148438				0	uz	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the number whose absolute value is to be calculated. The absolute value of a number is its value without the +/- sign.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
