helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148586				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COUNTBLANK(A1:B2)\</item\> returns 4 if cells A1, A2, B1, and B2 are all empty.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153114				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ACOS function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
