helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150128				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOS(-1)\</item\> returns 3.14159265358979 (PI radians)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8792382				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ACOS(0.5))\</item\> returns 60. The cosine of 60 degrees is 0.5.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145355				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ACOSH function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
