helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158419				0	uz	ACOT(Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	uz	 This function returns the inverse trigonometric cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the angle (in radians) whose cotangent is Number. The angle returned is between 0 and PI.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5834528				0	uz	To return the angle in degrees, use the DEGREES function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
