helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155375				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOT(1)\</item\> returns 0.785398163397448 (PI/4 radians).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8589434				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ACOT(1))\</item\> returns 45. The tangent of 45 degrees is 1. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148426				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ACOTH function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
