helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3146155				0	uz	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic cotangent is Number. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5818659				0	uz	An error results if Number is between -1 and 1 inclusive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083452				0	uz	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
