helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	uz	 This function returns the inverse trigonometric sine of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the angle (in radians) whose sine is Number. The angle returned is between -PI/2 and +PI/2.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
