helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6853846				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ASIN(1)\</item\> returns 1.5707963267949 (PI/2 radians). 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
