helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147621	104			0	uz	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic sine of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic sine is Number. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
