helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8746299				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ATAN(1))\</item\> returns 45. The tangent of 45 degrees is 1.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153983				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ATAN2 function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
