helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154297				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCTAN2\"\>Returns the inverse trigonometric tangent of the specified x and y coordinates.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
