helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5036164				0	uz	ATAN2 returns the inverse trigonometric tangent, that is, the angle (in radians) between the x-axis and a line from point NumberX, NumberY to the origin. The angle returned is between -PI and PI.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3001800				0	uz	To return the angle in degrees, use the DEGREES function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
