helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154692				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ATAN2(20;20)\</item\> returns 0.785398163397448 (PI/4 radians).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1477095				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ATAN2(12.3;12.3))\</item\> returns 45. The tangent of 45 degrees is 1.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
