helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150592				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_EXP\"\>Returns e raised to the power of a number.\</ahelp\> The constant e has a value of approximately 2.71828182845904.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
