helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145781				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>FACT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>factorials;numbers\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
