helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151109				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FAKULTAET\"\>Returns the factorial of a number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
