helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146				0	uz	INT(Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154117				0	uz	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> rounded down to the nearest integer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
