helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03070000.xhp\" name=\"Column & Row Headers\"\>Column & Row Headers\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
