helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155758				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>FISHERINV function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inverse of Fisher transformation\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
