helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148735				0	uz	\<variable id=\"yearfrac\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_yearfrac.xhp\"\>YEARFRAC\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3150899				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_YEARFRAC\"\> The result is a number between 0 and 1, representing the fraction of a year between \<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> and \<emph\>EndDate\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
