helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoOutline\"\>If the selected cell range contains formulas or references, $[officename] automatically outlines the selection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
