helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F7				0	uz	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\"\>File - Open\</link\> dialog to locate the spreadsheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
