helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_edate.xhp	0	help	par_id3150880	214			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_EDATE\"\>The result is a date which is a number of m\<emph\>onths\</emph\> away from the \<emph\>start date\</emph\>. Only months are considered; days are not used for calculation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
