helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	uz	To remove the highlighting, unmark the menu entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	uz	If this function is active, colors that you define in the document will not be displayed. When you deactivate the function, the user-defined colors are displayed again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
