helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145367				0	uz	\<variable id=\"autoformattext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Use this command to apply an AutoFormat to a selected sheet area or to define your own AutoFormats.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
