helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146115				0	uz	Alignment				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156445				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_AUTOFORMAT:BTN_ALIGNMENT\"\>When marked, specifies that you want to retain the alignment of the selected format.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
