helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3148901				0	uz	If type == 1: Length of the following string, including closing zero byte. If the length including closing zero byte equals an odd value a second zero byte is added to the string so that an even value is achieved. Therefore, Len is calculated using ((StrLen+2)&~1).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
