helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153904				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISEVEN_ADD(5)\</item\> returns 0.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id6238308				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISEVEN_ADD(A1)\</item\> returns 1 if cell A1 contains the number \<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154692				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ISNONTEXT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cell contents;no text\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
