helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3155330				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTKTEXT\"\>Tests if the cell contents are text or numbers, and returns FALSE if the contents are text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5719779				0	uz	If an error occurs, the function returns TRUE.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154931				0	uz	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148829				0	uz	ISNONTEXT(Value)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146992				0	uz	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is any value or expression where a test is performed to determine whether it is a text or numbers or a Boolean value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150525				0	uz	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149906				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNONTEXT(D2)\</item\> returns FALSE if cell D2 contains the text \<item type=\"input\"\>abcdef\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150777				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNONTEXT(D9)\</item\> returns TRUE if cell D9 contains the number \<item type=\"input\"\>8\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159148				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ISBLANK function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>blank cell contents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>empty cells; recognizing\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
