helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148800	78			0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTLEER\"\>Returns TRUE if the reference to a cell is blank.\</ahelp\> This function is used to determine if the content of a cell is empty. A cell with a formula inside is not empty. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159162				0	uz	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3158406				0	uz	ISBLANK(Value)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154212				0	uz	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is the content to be tested.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147508				0	uz	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147234				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISBLANK(D2)\</item\> returns FALSE as a result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155356				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ISLOGICAL function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>number formats;logical\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>logical number formats\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155356				0	uz	ISLOGICAL				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148926				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTLOG\"\>Tests for a logical value (TRUE or FALSE).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3541062				0	uz	If an error occurs, the function returns FALSE.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149162				0	uz	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148918				0	uz	ISLOGICAL(Value)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	uz	Returns TRUE if \<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a logical value (TRUE or FALSE), and returns FALSE otherwise.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150709				0	uz	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3166442				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISLOGICAL(99)\</item\> returns FALSE, because 99 is a number, not a logical value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3556016				0	uz	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISLOGICAL(ISNA(D4))\</item\> returns TRUE whatever the contents of cell D4, because ISNA() returns a logical value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153685				0	uz	\<bookmark_value\>ISNA function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>#N/A error;recognizing\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
