helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154618				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTZAHL\"\>Returns TRUE if the value refers to a number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
