helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154716				0	uz	\<emph\>InfoType\</emph\> is the character string that specifies the type of information. The character string is always in English. Upper or lower case is optional.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
