helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	uz	If a selected range has only one column, the content of the bottom most cell is copied into the selected cells. If several columns are selected, the contents of the bottom most cells are copied into those selected above.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
