helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eomonth.xhp	0	help	par_id3146787				0	uz	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> is a date (the starting point of the calculation).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eomonth.xhp	0	help	par_id3155615				0	uz	\<emph\>Months\</emph\> is the number of months before (negative) or after (positive) the start date.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
