helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149774				0	uz	Transparent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155074				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_PHANTOMX\"\>Inserts a placeholder for a transparent character. This character takes up the space of "a" but does not display it.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>phantom <?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_idN104E1				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3153240\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_bold.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153240\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
