helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10403				0	uz	\<image id=\"img_id3150173\" src=\"starmath/res/un21221.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150173\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
