helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\02090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145252				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_PREVMARK\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves the cursor to the previous marker (to the left).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\02090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	uz	"Markers" are placeholders. They take the form of <?> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
