helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149500				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TOOLBOX\"\>This is a list of operators, functions, symbols and format options that can be inserted into the formula.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	uz	The selection window is divided into two parts. Clicking a symbol at the top of the window displays its subordinate symbols in the lower half of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153250				0	uz	You can access the same functions in submenus through the context menu of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
