helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	uz	radian=(degree*pi)/180				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	uz	Pi is here the fixed circle constant with the rounded value 3.14159.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
