helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770	9			0	uz	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>DateSerial \</emph\>function. It returns the month in the year that corresponds to the serial date that is generated by \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\>. For example, the expression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
