helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150771				0	uz	Windowstyle				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	uz	Optional integer expression that specifies the style of the window that the program is executed in. The following values are possible:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	uz	0				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	uz	The focus is on the hidden program window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	uz	1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3144760				0	uz	The focus is on the program window in standard size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	uz	2				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	uz	The focus is on the minimized program window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	uz	3				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146921				0	uz	focus is on the maximized program window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	uz	4				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	uz	Standard size program window, without focus.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	uz	6				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152938				0	uz	Minimized program window, focus remains on the active window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	uz	10				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	uz	Full-screen display.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150419				0	uz	Param				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	uz	Any string expression that specifies the command line that want to pass.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148456				0	uz	bSync				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	uz	If this value is set to \<emph\>true\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Shell\</emph\> command and all $[officename] tasks wait until the shell process completes. If the value is set to \<emph\>false\</emph\>, the shell returns directly. The default value is \<emph\>false\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
