helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143270				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090405.xhp\" name=\"FreeLibrary Function [Runtime]\"\>FreeLibrary Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	uz	Releases DLLs that were loaded by a Declare statement. A released DLL is automatically reloaded if one of its functions is called. See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090403.xhp\" name=\"Declare\"\>Declare\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148550				0	uz	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	uz	FreeLibrary (LibName As String)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153380				0	uz	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	uz	\<emph\>LibName:\</emph\> String expression that specifies the name of the DLL.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	uz	FreeLibrary can only release DLLs that are loaded during Basic runtime.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
