helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143271				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090402.xhp\" name=\"Choose Function [Runtime]\"\>Choose Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
