helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798	6			0	uz	\<emph\>Text\</emph\>: String expression displayed as a message in the dialog box. Line breaks can be inserted with Chr$(13).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769	7			0	uz	\<emph\>DialogTitle\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the title bar of the dialog. If omitted, the title bar displays the name of the respective application.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228	8			0	uz	\<emph\>Type\</emph\>: Any integer expression that specifies the dialog type, as well as the number and type of buttons to display, and the icon type. \<emph\>Type\</emph\> represents a combination of bit patterns, that is, a combination of elements can be defined by adding their respective values:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161832				0	uz	0 : Display OK button only.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	uz	1 : Display OK and Cancel buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	uz	2 : Display Abort, Retry, and Ignore buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	uz	3 : Display Yes, No and Cancel buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155412				0	uz	4 : Display Yes and No buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	uz	5 : Display Retry and Cancel buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155				0	uz	16 : Add the Stop icon to the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145366				0	uz	32 : Add the Question icon to the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147350				0	uz	48 : Add the Exclamation icon to the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149960				0	uz	64 : Add the Information icon to the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	uz	128 : First button in the dialog as default button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417				0	uz	256 : Second button in the dialog as default button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	uz	512 : Third button in the dialog as default button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
