helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156042				0	uz	Comparison operators compare two expressions. The result is returned as a Boolean expression that determines if the comparison is True (-1) or False (0).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
