helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864	9			0	uz	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>TimeSerial \</emph\>function. It returns the seconds of a serial time value that is generated by the \<emph\>TimeSerial\</emph\> or \<emph\>TimeValue \</emph\>functions. For example, the expression:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	uz	Print Second(TimeSerial(12,30,41))				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	par_id3151117				0	uz	returns the value 41.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
