helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150327				0	uz	Select the module that you want to export as text from the object catalog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752				0	uz	Click the \<emph\>Save Source As\</emph\> icon in the Macro toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	uz	Select a file name and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to save the file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159264				0	uz	Loading Source Code From a Text File				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	uz	Select the module where you want to import the source code from the object catalog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230				0	uz	Position the cursor where you want to insert the program code.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565				0	uz	Click the \<emph\>Insert Source Text\</emph\> icon in the Macro toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	uz	Select the text file containing the source code and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
