helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149416				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080202.xhp\" name=\"Log Function [Runtime]\"\>Log Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145066				0	uz	Returns the natural logarithm of a number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
