helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120403.xhp	0	help	par_id3146796				0	uz	\<emph\>Compare:\</emph\> This optional parameter sets the comparison method. If Compare = 1, the string comparison is case-sensitive. If Compare = 0, no distinction is made between uppercase and lowercase letters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120403.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154940				0	uz	Return value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120403.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	uz	If Text1 < Text2 the function returns -1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120403.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	uz	If Text1 = Text2 the function returns 0				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120403.xhp	0	help	par_id3158410				0	uz	If Text1 > Text2 the function returns 1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
