helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154125				0	uz	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	uz	\<emph\>GoTo Labelname:\</emph\> If an error occurs, enables the error-handling routine that starts at the line "Labelname".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	uz	\<emph\>Resume Next:\</emph\> If an error occurs, program execution continues with the statement that follows the statement in which the error occurred.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149482				0	uz	\<emph\>GoTo 0: \</emph\>Disables the error handler in the current procedure.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
