helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	uz	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to calculate the tangent for (in radians).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153728				0	uz	To convert degrees to radians, multiply by Pi/180. To convert radians to degrees, multiply by 180/Pi.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
