helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909	9			0	uz	This function is the opposite of the \<emph\>TimeSerial\</emph\> function. It returns an integer value that represents the hour from a time value that is generated by the \<emph\>TimeSerial\</emph\> or the \<emph\>TimeValue \</emph\>function. For example, the expression				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030201.xhp	0	help	par_id3163798				0	uz	Print Hour(TimeSerial(12:30:41))				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	uz	returns the value 12.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
