helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	uz	\<emph\>[Dimension]:\</emph\> Integer that specifies which dimension to return the upper(\<emph\>Ubound\</emph\>) or lower (\<emph\>LBound\</emph\>) boundary for. If no value is specified, the boundary of the first dimension is returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
