helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id9174779				0	uz	If Root displayed is set to FALSE, the root node of a model is no longer a valid node for the tree control and can't be used with any method of XTreeControl.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
