helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\control_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317				0	uz	You can set the properties of control that you add to a dialog. For example, you can change the color, name, and size of a button that you added. You can change most control properties when you create or edit a dialog. However, you can only change some properties at runtime.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
