helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\20000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147382				0	uz	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPatternField\"\>Adds a masked field.\</ahelp\> A masked field consists of an input mask and a literal mask. The input mask determines which user data can be entered. The literal mask determines the state of the masked field when the form is loaded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
