helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	uz	\<variable id=\"sytextxgitter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToggleGridHorizontal\"\>The \<emph\>Horizontal Grid On/Off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> bar toggles the visibility of the grid display for the X axis. Note: This only works if the \<emph\>Minor grid\</emph\> check boxes in \<emph\>Insert - Grids\</emph\> are cleared.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Otherwise, the minor grid remains visible when the major grid is turned off.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
