helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	uz	Alignment				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149656				0	uz	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05020201.xhp\" name=\"Alignment\"\>Alignment\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	uz	Modifies the alignment of axes or title labels.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	uz	Some of the options listed here are not available for all labels. For example, there are different options for 2D and 3D object labels.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750				0	uz	Show labels				2002-02-02 02:02:02
